/**
 * THE CATALOGUE MANIFEST
 *
 * Every page brief from the master brief (30 October 2026): the 186 foundational leaf briefs of Appendix C
 * (170 original catalogue IDs, some split into several pages) and the 12 industry extensions of Appendix I.
 * This is the coverage source of truth: `scripts/catalogue-coverage.ts` writes audit/catalogue/COVERAGE.md
 * from it, and service pages are built from it as their content is written.
 *
 * What is here is the brief, transcribed: focus, pricing blueprint, tier overrides, required proof and
 * acceptance. It is not page copy and none of it is published by itself. The "proposed route" is the brief's
 * suggestion; `canonical` in data/catalogue/routes.ts decides the real URL against the existing site.
 */

